      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what you're saying about \"legacy\" and stuff, but it honestly feels like patronizing nonsense. it's not just \"grief,\" it's like... the math doesn't add up anymore. i put 20 years of my existence into a ledger that is now just showing zero. i'm 45. i've spent my entire adult life working toward something that evaporated. it feels like i was playing a game where the rules changed at the very end and now i'm just stuck in a room with nothing left to do. i'm just tired of trying to find \"purpose\" in the ruins.",
